<title>POLAND: POLFA KUTNO SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLFA KUTNO SEPT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.58 vs   1.71</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.00 vs   2.21</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.52 vs   2.49</p>
<p> Sales		   15.28 vs  12.00</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    12.84 vs   8.45</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	20.08 vs  13.19</p>
<p> Operating profit    19.79 vs  16.33</p>
<p> Sales		  126.92 vs 108.50</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish pharmaceuticals firm is Polfa</p>
<p>Kutno SA. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
